289
00:21:31,176 --> 00:21:33,485
All the time I've spent with you,

290
00:21:34,349 --> 00:21:36,254
I've been so happy.

291
00:21:42,097 --> 00:21:43,163
I'm not sure…

292
00:21:43,429 --> 00:21:45,163
if you feel the same way.

293
00:21:46,924 --> 00:21:47,757
Would it be okay…

294
00:21:48,417 --> 00:21:49,743
if I asked you to be my boyfriend?

295
00:21:49,768 --> 00:21:50,564
Sure.

296
00:21:50,619 --> 00:21:51,119
Huh?

297
00:21:51,450 --> 00:21:52,250
I'll be your boyfriend.

298
00:21:52,817 --> 00:21:54,126
I haven't asked you yet.

299
00:21:54,151 --> 00:21:54,917
It's fine.

300
00:21:54,917 --> 00:21:55,717
I can be your boyfriend right now.

301
00:21:56,283 --> 00:21:57,626
Let me ask you out first.

302
00:21:58,189 --> 00:21:59,623
Hurry up then.

303
00:22:02,251 --> 00:22:02,751
Yok.

304
00:22:04,123 --> 00:22:05,335
You're the person…

305
00:22:06,199 --> 00:22:07,647
who is so adorable.

306
00:22:08,664 --> 00:22:11,653
I like you so much.

307
00:22:13,245 --> 00:22:16,871
And I like it when we dance aerobics together.

308
00:22:18,284 --> 00:22:19,498
Would it be okay…

309
00:22:20,996 --> 00:22:23,125
if I ask you to dance aerobics with me…

310
00:22:23,150 --> 00:22:25,054
for a long time?

311
00:22:26,020 --> 00:22:26,851
Will you be my boyfriend?

312
00:22:27,351 --> 00:22:29,517
I will, I will be your boyfriend.

313
00:22:30,351 --> 00:22:31,617
I'm taken!

314
00:23:01,484 --> 00:23:05,851
I guess painless love does exist.

315
00:23:27,851 --> 00:23:29,851
Tee, trust me.

316
00:23:38,051 --> 00:23:41,215
Hello? Have you arrived?

317
00:23:42,384 --> 00:23:44,178
Okay.

318
00:23:44,788 --> 00:23:45,710
Alright.

319
00:24:01,251 --> 00:24:03,551
Come with me, please.

320
00:24:23,217 --> 00:24:27,451
Please let me explain first.

321
00:24:30,684 --> 00:24:32,317
The guy you saw in the picture,

322
00:24:33,450 --> 00:24:34,683
he is actually my brother.

323
00:24:36,010 --> 00:24:37,576
But the guy you saw on the other day,

324
00:24:38,809 --> 00:24:40,109
he is also my brother.

325
00:24:41,910 --> 00:24:43,410
My adoptive brother.

326
00:24:47,990 --> 00:24:48,823
Hey, Jeen.

327
00:24:50,351 --> 00:24:51,151
France.

328
00:24:53,517 --> 00:24:55,051
Did you really call your date all the way here?

329
00:24:55,817 --> 00:24:57,451
Your brother isn't named Tea anymore?

330
00:25:02,444 --> 00:25:03,644
Is that your friend?

331
00:25:04,590 --> 00:25:05,990
I mean…

332
00:25:06,049 --> 00:25:08,761
Don't tell me you have someone else.

333
00:25:11,251 --> 00:25:14,617
If you're gonna be with someone else,
at least pick someone better.

334
00:25:15,084 --> 00:25:15,884
What did you say?

335
00:25:18,759 --> 00:25:20,047
Tee.

336
00:25:22,088 --> 00:25:23,117
Chill out.

337
00:25:23,117 --> 00:25:23,917
Enough.

338
00:25:25,837 --> 00:25:26,803
I think that's enough.

339
00:25:28,537 --> 00:25:30,204
France is right.

340
00:25:31,317 --> 00:25:32,850
I should have made a better choice.

341
00:25:36,684 --> 00:25:38,484
When I first saw you,

342
00:25:39,684 --> 00:25:41,317
I thought you were really cool.

343
00:25:42,717 --> 00:25:44,051
So I decided to date you.

344
00:25:47,084 --> 00:25:49,084
I never thought it would be this boring.

345
00:25:52,884 --> 00:25:53,920
Can you believe it?

346
00:25:54,428 --> 00:25:55,643
We've been together for a whole year.

347
00:25:56,355 --> 00:25:57,501
And nothing has happened between us.

348
00:25:58,416 --> 00:26:01,517
When I'm with you,
I feel like I'm hanging out with friends.

349
00:26:03,017 --> 00:26:04,951
So why would I even have you as a boyfriend?

350
00:26:07,251 --> 00:26:08,317
But with France,

351
00:26:09,251 --> 00:26:10,751
he can do everything for me.

352
00:26:12,684 --> 00:26:14,084
Being with him feels like we're dating.

353
00:26:16,951 --> 00:26:18,717
Everything you've never done to me,

354
00:26:20,351 --> 00:26:22,051
he can do it all.

355
00:26:27,951 --> 00:26:30,484
Why don't you just break up with me?

356
00:26:33,423 --> 00:26:35,089
Why don't you just break up with me then?

357
00:26:37,997 --> 00:26:41,331
I know that you're not that into me.

358
00:26:43,704 --> 00:26:45,604
You're not breaking up with me…

359
00:26:46,570 --> 00:26:47,884
because you're afraid of being a bad person, right?

360
00:26:52,684 --> 00:26:53,484
Alright.

361
00:26:54,484 --> 00:26:55,951
I'll be a bad person instead.

362
00:26:58,917 --> 00:26:59,917
Let's break up.

363
00:27:04,084 --> 00:27:06,284
So you can find someone you really like.

364
00:27:10,517 --> 00:27:11,517
I'm exhausted.

365
00:27:14,651 --> 00:27:16,851
I'd rather choose someone who shares my vibes.

366
00:27:26,551 --> 00:27:27,351
Hey, France.

367
00:27:27,951 --> 00:27:28,884
Are you here too?

368
00:27:29,284 --> 00:27:30,084
And…

369
00:27:30,917 --> 00:27:31,717
Who is this girl?

370
00:27:32,417 --> 00:27:33,251
I'm France's girlfriend.

371
00:27:33,517 --> 00:27:34,279
He's my boyfriend.

372
00:27:34,279 --> 00:27:35,031
Huh?

373
00:27:35,056 --> 00:27:36,626
What do you mean? He's my boyfriend.

374
00:27:36,651 --> 00:27:37,151
He's my boyfriend.

375
00:27:37,151 --> 00:27:37,972
He's my boyfriend.

376
00:27:37,972 --> 00:27:38,472
He's my boyfriend.

377
00:27:38,497 --> 00:27:39,292
He's my boyfriend.

378
00:27:39,317 --> 00:27:39,817
He's my boyfriend.

379
00:27:39,846 --> 00:27:40,853
Baby.

380
00:27:41,151 --> 00:27:41,951
Hey.

381
00:27:41,951 --> 00:27:43,280
What are you doing with my boyfriend?

382
00:27:43,280 --> 00:27:44,186
Get out.

383
00:27:44,211 --> 00:27:44,825
Ouch.

384
00:27:44,851 --> 00:27:46,292
Hey, get out.

385
00:27:46,317 --> 00:27:47,117
Wait.

386
00:27:47,884 --> 00:27:48,715
France.

387
00:27:48,715 --> 00:27:49,215
Hey.

388
00:27:49,517 --> 00:27:50,317
France.

389
00:27:51,496 --> 00:27:52,350
What's going on?

390
00:27:52,375 --> 00:27:53,856
Hey, stop. Stop it.

391
00:27:54,497 --> 00:27:55,897
Why are you fighting right here?

392
00:27:56,825 --> 00:27:58,425
You're from other schools, right?

393
00:27:58,870 --> 00:28:00,337
Please leave our school right now.

394
00:28:01,430 --> 00:28:02,230
Please leave.

395
00:28:02,663 --> 00:28:03,463
I said leave.

396
00:28:03,997 --> 00:28:05,930
Gosh, these kids.

397
00:28:08,150 --> 00:28:10,050
Did you two have a fight with them too?

398
00:28:10,322 --> 00:28:11,122
No, we didn't.

399
00:28:11,669 --> 00:28:13,969
Head inside then. The activity is about to start.

400
00:28:14,237 --> 00:28:15,037
Okay.

401
00:28:15,470 --> 00:28:18,437
Seriously, there's drama every single day.
What a chaotic school.

402
00:28:29,390 --> 00:28:30,356
I'm sorry.

403
00:28:32,810 --> 00:28:33,843
Why did you say sorry?

404
00:28:36,276 --> 00:28:37,743
I'm sorry that she was the one who said it.

405
00:28:38,437 --> 00:28:39,237
Not me.

406
00:28:43,284 --> 00:28:44,317
That's not the point.

407
00:28:46,456 --> 00:28:47,490
Were you shocked?

408
00:28:50,764 --> 00:28:52,364
You already knew it?

409
00:28:53,837 --> 00:28:54,637
Um.

410
00:29:01,830 --> 00:29:03,563
But Jeen was right.

411
00:29:06,116 --> 00:29:08,137
I shouldn't have waited until she did something wrong.

412
00:29:10,870 --> 00:29:12,203
If I don't like her anymore,

413
00:29:12,770 --> 00:29:14,670
I should have broken up with her in the first place.

414
00:29:19,203 --> 00:29:21,070
No one is entirely at fault.

415
00:29:22,670 --> 00:29:26,137
At least everyone has moved on their own path now.

416
00:29:29,237 --> 00:29:30,803
Will you stay with me then?

417
00:29:34,737 --> 00:29:35,870
I'm not going anywhere.

418
00:29:38,270 --> 00:29:39,870
If you want me to stay,

419
00:29:40,903 --> 00:29:41,937
I'm happy to stay.

420
00:29:43,803 --> 00:29:44,837
Don't go anywhere.

421
00:29:47,070 --> 00:29:47,870
Okay.

422
00:29:53,503 --> 00:29:54,303
Kids.

423
00:29:54,803 --> 00:29:55,237
Yes?

424
00:29:55,237 --> 00:29:57,437
The gift-giving activity is about to start inside.

425
00:29:57,903 --> 00:29:59,603
Shall we go inside?

426
00:29:59,903 --> 00:30:00,403
Okay.

427
00:30:00,403 --> 00:30:00,915
Okay.

428
00:30:00,915 --> 00:30:01,703
Let's go.

429
00:30:01,937 --> 00:30:04,837
Everyone, let's head inside. The activity is about to start.

430
00:30:07,470 --> 00:30:08,270
Fuse.

431
00:30:08,850 --> 00:30:10,350
Can I ask you a favor?

432
00:30:15,956 --> 00:30:17,237
Can you take of this costume?

433
00:30:20,270 --> 00:30:23,070
Why? Isn't it cute?

434
00:30:25,903 --> 00:30:26,909
It is.

435
00:30:27,875 --> 00:30:30,337
But it's too cute. I'm jealous.

436
00:31:49,040 --> 00:31:49,793
Oh.

437
00:31:50,545 --> 00:31:51,677
How did you get in here?

438
00:31:51,919 --> 00:31:52,761
Hey.

439
00:31:53,369 --> 00:31:54,737
You once made a spare key for me.

440
00:31:54,737 --> 00:31:55,537
Did you forget?

441
00:31:56,604 --> 00:31:57,404
Hmm.

442
00:31:58,570 --> 00:31:59,804
I'm taking it back.

443
00:32:01,108 --> 00:32:02,175
Why didn't you tell me before coming?

444
00:32:03,082 --> 00:32:04,382
You can take it back.

445
00:32:04,393 --> 00:32:06,093
I'll made ten spare keys instead.

446
00:32:07,177 --> 00:32:08,411
Are you crazy?

447
00:32:10,255 --> 00:32:11,155
Come here.

448
00:32:14,149 --> 00:32:14,949
Come and eat.

449
00:32:15,293 --> 00:32:16,259
I've made plenty.

450
00:32:20,467 --> 00:32:22,834
I made it myself and I already tried it.

451
00:32:23,970 --> 00:32:27,170
Hey, anyone can do that.

452
00:32:27,935 --> 00:32:29,242
But my eggs…

453
00:32:29,683 --> 00:32:30,663
are exceptionally delicious.

454
00:32:31,467 --> 00:32:35,681
Since I do it hard, I mean I put my heart into it.

455
00:32:37,658 --> 00:32:38,525
Come on.

456
00:32:45,675 --> 00:32:46,909
Let's eat vegetable first.

457
00:32:48,973 --> 00:32:49,773
Here.

458
00:32:58,222 --> 00:32:59,022
Is it good?

459
00:33:02,343 --> 00:33:03,409
Another one?

460
00:33:43,263 --> 00:33:45,297
Oh, I made a mess.

461
00:33:46,073 --> 00:33:46,873
It's okay.

462
00:33:50,553 --> 00:33:51,441
Hold on.

463
00:33:51,641 --> 00:33:52,519
Hmm?

464
00:33:52,604 --> 00:33:54,471
You're eating without a fork?

465
00:33:56,423 --> 00:33:57,223
Oh right.

466
00:33:58,366 --> 00:33:59,399
How should I eat it then?

467
00:35:01,210 --> 00:35:02,276
I'll check it out.

468
00:35:02,384 --> 00:35:03,850
Hold on, don't leave yet.

469
00:35:04,477 --> 00:35:06,344
Wait a sec. I'll be right back.

470
00:35:06,616 --> 00:35:08,442
Book, just a moment.

471
00:35:10,282 --> 00:35:11,115
Wait here.

472
00:35:44,802 --> 00:35:49,435
How have you been, Book?
Struggling with anything lately?

473
00:35:51,326 --> 00:35:52,126
Not at all.

474
00:35:54,063 --> 00:35:59,830
Don't you miss me? You’ve never called me.

475
00:36:14,405 --> 00:36:15,639
Is that your friend?

476
00:36:16,163 --> 00:36:16,963
Yes.

477
00:36:21,550 --> 00:36:24,184
I'm happy that you have a friend with you.

478
00:36:28,563 --> 00:36:32,663
Well… has your dad called you?

479
00:36:34,487 --> 00:36:35,487
Uh, he hasn't.

480
00:36:56,394 --> 00:36:57,383
Book…

481
00:36:58,897 --> 00:37:00,290
Well…

482
00:37:03,374 --> 00:37:04,947
Your dad and I are divorced.

483
00:37:08,270 --> 00:37:12,405
I'm sorry I couldn't give you a complete family.

484
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,367
It's okay.

485
00:37:27,330 --> 00:37:28,650
As long as you're happy,

486
00:37:30,215 --> 00:37:31,754
that's already a complete family to me.

487
00:37:39,394 --> 00:37:40,505
For me,

488
00:37:42,137 --> 00:37:43,755
as long as you still here,

489
00:37:44,382 --> 00:37:46,359
I still have my family.

490
00:37:48,809 --> 00:37:53,409
I'm happy to see you loving yourself again.

491
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:01,680
I'm sorry, sweetheart.

492
00:38:04,356 --> 00:38:06,900
I'll pull myself together.

493
00:38:07,736 --> 00:38:10,117
Find a job.

494
00:38:11,282 --> 00:38:13,093
And visit you more often. Sound good?

495
00:38:14,192 --> 00:38:15,168
Most importantly,

496
00:38:16,397 --> 00:38:18,797
let's go on a lot of trips together, okay?

497
00:38:19,663 --> 00:38:20,463
Okay.

498
00:39:06,714 --> 00:39:08,257
Hello, Fuse.

499
00:39:08,480 --> 00:39:10,170
Hello, Yimwan.

500
00:39:10,523 --> 00:39:11,850
You look as beautiful as always.

501
00:39:11,909 --> 00:39:15,123
You're such a sweet talker.

502
00:39:15,207 --> 00:39:16,343
Please have a seat.

503
00:39:17,247 --> 00:39:18,047
Thank you.

504
00:39:18,460 --> 00:39:19,723
Enjoy your breakfast.

505
00:39:19,777 --> 00:39:20,277
Thanks.

506
00:39:24,576 --> 00:39:26,576
Annyeonghaseyo.

507
00:39:27,314 --> 00:39:30,575
Tee told me you like Korean food.

508
00:39:30,575 --> 00:39:33,347
So I told Yimwan to prepare Korean food for you.

509
00:39:34,363 --> 00:39:37,196
Oh, okay.

510
00:39:40,227 --> 00:39:42,994
Where is Tee by the way?

511
00:39:43,481 --> 00:39:47,247
You only asked about him as soon as you arrived.
Not even a single word about me.

512
00:39:47,687 --> 00:39:49,353
But I really meant to come and see you.

513
00:39:57,581 --> 00:40:01,031
Tee is upstairs, probably asleep.

514
00:40:01,031 --> 00:40:03,747
Go check on him and bring him down for breakfast.

515
00:40:04,007 --> 00:40:04,807
Okay.

516
00:40:12,260 --> 00:40:13,293
Tim.

517
00:40:15,860 --> 00:40:17,260
Oppa saranghae.

518
00:40:43,047 --> 00:40:44,116
Tee.

519
00:40:47,573 --> 00:40:49,800
Tee, I'm here.

520
00:40:50,447 --> 00:40:51,247
Wake up.

521
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:56,320
What a heavy sleeper.

522
00:40:59,547 --> 00:41:00,347
What?

523
00:41:01,981 --> 00:41:04,089
Tee, I'm here.

524
00:41:05,147 --> 00:41:05,947
Hey.

525
00:41:11,647 --> 00:41:12,981
You're heavy.

526
00:41:34,640 --> 00:41:38,294
If you're not waking up, I'd better go.

527
00:41:40,640 --> 00:41:42,337
Hey, don't leave yet.

528
00:41:43,675 --> 00:41:44,729
What’s the rush?

529
00:41:47,774 --> 00:41:48,974
Because you weren't waking up.

530
00:41:50,047 --> 00:41:51,514
Why didn't you wake me up nicely?

531
00:41:52,654 --> 00:41:53,621
What do you mean by "nicely"?

532
00:41:54,767 --> 00:41:55,567
Like this.

533
00:41:56,841 --> 00:41:58,107
Are you messing with me?

534
00:41:59,080 --> 00:42:02,247
If you kiss me, I'll get right up.

535
00:42:04,047 --> 00:42:07,381
Get up. Tim is waiting, we'd better go downstairs.

536
00:42:09,647 --> 00:42:11,435
You're single now.

537
00:42:12,381 --> 00:42:13,881
Can I kiss you, please?

538
00:42:14,881 --> 00:42:15,947
You can't.

539
00:42:18,181 --> 00:42:19,347
Because your breath smells.

540
00:42:19,714 --> 00:42:20,914
Go brush your teeth.

541
00:42:23,147 --> 00:42:24,547
Give me three minutes.

542
00:42:25,247 --> 00:42:26,347
Wait for me here.

543
00:42:26,747 --> 00:42:27,547
Don't go anywhere.

544
00:42:28,114 --> 00:42:29,082
I'll be right back.

545
00:42:29,082 --> 00:42:29,781
Um.

546
00:42:34,514 --> 00:42:35,647
Don't go anywhere.

547
00:42:36,114 --> 00:42:36,914
I'll be right back.

548
00:42:37,014 --> 00:42:38,443
I know.

549
00:42:56,881 --> 00:42:58,281
Tee, your phone.

550
00:42:58,914 --> 00:43:00,681
Can you check who it is?

551
00:43:12,499 --> 00:43:14,499
(Tee.)

552
00:43:15,653 --> 00:43:17,653
(Where are you?)

553
00:43:18,187 --> 00:43:20,187
(I really want to see you.)

554
00:43:20,496 --> 00:43:21,738
(I can't take it anymore.)

555
00:43:21,738 --> 00:43:25,610
(Can you come back to me?)

556
00:43:51,481 --> 00:43:52,781
What did you do to my person?

557
00:43:53,527 --> 00:43:55,093
You shouldn't be asking me.

558
00:43:55,647 --> 00:43:57,114
You should go ask your own person.

559
00:43:57,301 --> 00:43:58,507
Why are you sulking?

560
00:43:58,973 --> 00:43:59,773
Can you tell me about it?

561
00:43:59,947 --> 00:44:01,147
Your ex.

562
00:44:01,847 --> 00:44:03,023
She's your friend.

563
00:44:03,248 --> 00:44:04,317
I'm also your friend.

564
00:44:05,013 --> 00:44:06,380
It's not my place to stop you.

565
00:44:07,181 --> 00:44:08,614
Can I ask your advice on something?

566
00:44:09,100 --> 00:44:11,631
No matter what happens from now on,

567
00:44:12,083 --> 00:44:13,564
I'll never give up.

568
00:44:13,809 --> 00:44:15,776
What about you? Can you do it?
